{"id":"en_stealing-the-sun","title":"Stealing the Sun","titleEn":"Stealing the Sun","description":"Sloane endured a childhood marked by her mother's poisonous quiet and a stepfather who preyed on her, leaving her trapped in relentless gloom. Rescue came through Oliver, her stepbrother, who pulled her from that abyss and shielded her with a devotion that was itself delicate. Convinced she was destroying him, she ran away, thinking distance would release him from her weight. What she failed to see as she left was that Oliver never regarded her as a burden at all; she was the very pulse that kept him alive.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/c95226565d5f6206/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/c95226565d5f6206/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Romance","Contemporary","Urban","Family","Coming-of-Age","Romance"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl2ze/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_stealing-the-sun_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl2ze/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_stealing-the-sun_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl2ze/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_stealing-the-sun_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl2ze/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_stealing-the-sun_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl2ze/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_stealing-the-sun_5",